flowchart TD
    IN[Claim submitted] --> INT[Intake Agent]
    INT -->|missing fields| REJ[Rejected: incomplete]
    INT --> DOC[Document Verification]
    DOC -->|missing docs| ROUTER
    DOC --> TRI[Fraud Triage Agent<br/>velocity + tenure only]
    TRI -->|obvious fraud| ROUTER
    TRI --> DMG[Damage Assessment Agent]
    DMG --> SCO[Fraud Scoring Agent<br/>cost anomaly + photo forensics]
    SCO -->|fraud signal| ROUTER
    SCO --> COV[Policy Coverage Agent]
    COV -->|not covered| DENY[Claim Not Payable]
    COV -->|over limit| ROUTER
    COV --> APR[Approval Agent]
    APR -->|over threshold| ROUTER
    APR --> PAY[Payment Agent<br/>idempotency key]
    PAY --> DONE[Claim Paid]

    ROUTER{Case Resolution Router}
    ROUTER -->|missing_docs resolved| DOC
    ROUTER -->|fraud cleared, pre-assessment| DMG
    ROUTER -->|fraud cleared, post-assessment| COV
    ROUTER -->|fraud confirmed| DENY
    ROUTER -->|estimate adjusted| APR
    ROUTER -->|high-value approved| PAY
    ROUTER -->|upheld / unrecognized| DENY

    AUD[(Compliance & Audit Trail<br/>Decision Ledger)]
    INT -.-> AUD
    DOC -.-> AUD
    TRI -.-> AUD
    DMG -.-> AUD
    SCO -.-> AUD
    COV -.-> AUD
    APR -.-> AUD
    ROUTER -.-> AUD
    PAY -.-> AUD
    DENY -.-> AUD

    style TRI fill:#c9d6ff
    style SCO fill:#c9d6ff
    style ROUTER fill:#ffe0a3
    style AUD fill:#d9d9d9
    style DENY fill:#ffb3b3
    style DONE fill:#b3ffb3
